 @partyjerk  Here we go again, ever even tried an AMD GPU? I was the same snobbish fuck talking out of my ass about AMD drivers until I finally tried a Radeon GPU, the 6900 XT, and my experience has been nothing short of impeccable, despite having dual monitors and a VR headset which is supposed to be "buggy". Hell, I've had more issues with NoVideo's latest 5xx line of drivers than I've ever had with these Radeon drivers - and AMD Adrenalin is an amazing piece of software with UI and functionality that puts NoVideo's jurassic control panel and useless GeForce Experience to shame. Games run smoother now in terms of 0.1% and 1% lows, and performance in Vulkan & OpenGL games has increased massively.

